Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:07.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,A hundred more push-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm melting...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Another ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.17,0:00:14.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thirty more squats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(371.2,540)}{\an7}Potato Killer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alone at last...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Time to eat some-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:27.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844.8,540)}{\an7}Meow Meow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:33.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's all you get for dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:44.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,64.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:42.29,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,604.8)}{\an7}The Beefy Soldier and Remnants of a Dream
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:47.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human... I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.63,0:01:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, she is losing weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:53.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But this diet of hers isn't healthy at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.75,0:01:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That hits the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.79,0:01:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human? What's with the grumpy face?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:01:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can tell me if something's bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:04.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're friends, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's the one who's suffering, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:09.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I doing...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:11.92,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(243.2,360)}{\an7}Be ye reconciled to spuds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:15.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your break is over.\NIt's time for sword practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:16.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.21,0:02:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now get into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll start with a thousand swings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,G-got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:32.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Put your back into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it's hard on an empty stomach...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Quit complaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be tired yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come on, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:50.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:52.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you step aside, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:02:57.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elfuda is MY patient!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.83,0:03:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'M the one responsible for\Nhelping her lose weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, no! I will NOT step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I can't convince you otherwise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:09.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure what to do\Nafter our conversation...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:12.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I never should have\Ndoubted myself in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because the solution was clear all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,The way you try to wear her down\Nand break her spirit isn't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:20.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then you leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-human, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please don't do this, Auntie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll move you by force!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't even bat an eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still, that doesn't necessarily mean\Nyour methods are effective-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,His methods ARE effective!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,He helped me lose weight once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's my lifestyle that's the real problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you know that, then fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eek, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I put my faith in the human!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,And in return, he's given me lots of knowledge\Nand taught me a bunch of techniques!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:03:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,if I'm going to lose weight again,\Nit'll be with HIS guidance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:07.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Telling me exactly what's on her mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's never done that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.67,0:04:14.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The human can take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:18.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Auntie...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:24.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll report the situation back to Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Be sure to follow the human's advice\Nand make an effort to form good habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, Auntie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll keep a close eye on Elfuda's progress\Nso she can lose weight in a healthy way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,And try to pay your mother a visit\Nfrom time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:43.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.75,0:04:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what happened, Auntie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't get through the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:55.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:57.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder why...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:04:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,THAT'S why!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:02.96,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,460.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:02.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus-Sized Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's already started the intensive training...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.17,0:05:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, the human and the spherical elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:13.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kuroeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We decided to join my auntie\Nfor her training session.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which...\Nwhat was that about "spherical"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:20.38,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.4,129.6)}{\an7}I ♥ GREASE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wha-?! You look...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.29,0:05:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe YOU should consider\Ntraining with my auntie, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you want to look as good as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:32.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm? I certainly don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right.\NPerhaps that would be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,As thanks for the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:45.00,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,381.6)}{\an7}Valid for a free order of fries
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,A coupon for French fries?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fries aren't a part of Elfuda's diet right-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess I was wrong about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on!\NYou worked so hard to lose weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's the harm in ONE order of fries?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a little reward for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,French fries, French fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:06:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't really remember much from that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:04.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.21,0:06:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that... our elven friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sh-she's so slim...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Flatter than a flounder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why, she must've worked herself to the bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:18.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't let her outshine me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.42,Q8,,0,0,0,,Me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:25.79,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.2,86.4)}{\an7}Mega-size Fries
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Starting today, our legendary "Mega-Size Fries"\Nare back by popular demand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:25.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would you like to try some?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,L-legendary...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, come again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.17,0:06:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't pass up a legendary opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I don't get to be happy,\Nthen neither do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So ya want a gemstone to make\Na pwetty neckwace, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:44.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I gotcha. Well, since you're a fwiend...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:47.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,My wecommendation is this turquoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oooh, sparkly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:51.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I like it! How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll give ya a nice discount...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.17,0:06:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,So expensive! Can you go a little lower?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.67,0:07:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,If there's one fing cylopes know,\Nit's how to spot a quawity cwystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:04.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fwashin' her a fake ain't gonna fwy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:08.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Since I'm sellin' her the weal deal,\NI gotta milk her for all she's worf!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, I'll lift you way up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:12.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,So... deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I ain't makin' it cheaper for THIS!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm an entrepweneur, ya bozo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:18.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I caught you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew it. You are trying to be\Nher mommy, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no, looks like she's itching for a fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's continue this another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:33.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pwease don't weave me alone with the ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:37.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll give ya the turquoise\Nfor twenty percent off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Grr...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Firty percent off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:44.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now get her cwazy ass outta my park!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your offer has been accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's time to settle which of us\Nis the mightier mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't care a whole lot about\Nbeing a mother, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.25,0:07:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want that gemstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:07:59.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Brand new snack flavors!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come and get your free samples!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.42,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,302.4)}{\an7}Potato & Cheese
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:04.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here you go, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's my lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:14.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You volunteered to train with me\Nand yet you're quitting already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one told me... it was going to be...\Nthis intense...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:20.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Another hundred squats to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:23.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do you expect to be an\Naccomplished mage with such weak legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,My legs have nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where is the Dragon Slenderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:30.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,The dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,When the hell did you get here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:34.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Dragon Slenderer"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's her nickname for the human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:38.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,He isn't home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.75,0:08:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unfortunate, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then you shall provide me warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Warmth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was cold outside, so warm me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously, who died and made you king?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:54.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have the audacity to defy\Nan apex predator such as I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.50,0:08:58.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,All that blubber ought to keep you\Nwarm enough, you pudgy lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You shall rue the day...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:04.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,you dared to cross me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.71,0:09:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once the ogre starts to swow down,\NI'll punch her wights out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:20.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I get the final bwow,\Nthe cyclops pays full pwice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:23.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're wide open for a body shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:25.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have some payback!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's staggered! Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fatality incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, pipsqueak?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't intervene in a fight,\Nit's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:42.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I'm relieved you didn't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:44.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,My cwothes beg to differ...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The human's apartment is nearby.\NLet's head there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,This was all your fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:55.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good thing the human lives close to the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:09:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yo, human! Sorry to barge in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.04,0:10:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was trying to do my usual\Nstrength training regimen...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to buy a pretty gemstone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just look at you sad sacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,More rolls than a bakery!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:18.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe you guys ought to be a little more\Nambitious and try having some self-control!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:25.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't talk down to us just because-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're back to the same size as before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Care to explain yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:32.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whaaat? What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:35.21,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,93.6)}{\an7}Massage Relaxation
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:35.21,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,619.2)}{\an7}Beauty  Health  Diet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But why would you eat that many French fries?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:42.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, they were there, so...\Nthat's the best I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I was wrong to trust\Nthe human with your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The human can help me lose weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.33,0:10:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm committed to giving her\Nthe support she needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:59.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm in your hands once again... Naoe!
